00:18:50,640 --> 00:19:07,360
who began to build our intellectual inheritance rather less than ten thousand years ago." This idea people have that Newton was the first modern scientist is somehow wrong.

102
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:19,440
There's some truth to it, but he really had this very different way of looking at the world that was part superstitious and part modern. It was a funny hybrid.

103
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:30,400
He's a transitional figure in some sense. That phrase, "the last of the magicians," really points at something. The thing I'm very curious

104
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:43,360
